title: Check the validation data
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    Candidate validation now ensures that the `PersistedValidationData` hash matches the
    `persisted_validation_data_hash` in the candidate descriptor, which is the one checked
    on chain. Candidates failing this check are rejected with the new
    `InvalidCandidate::PersistedValidationDataMismatch`.
crates:
- name: polkadot-node-core-candidate-validation
  bump: patch
- name: polkadot-node-primitives
  bump: major
  validate: false
